# p2-ascent.drv - Phase 2 tour: lift off from an atmospheric surface port
# under an overcast and climb through the cloud deck into space.
#
# Verifies: clouds2 (W5b) the sky deck seen from the pad and from below,
# the whitening inside it, the deck from above, and that the deck hands
# over to the orbit view of the clouds (procfx PF_CLOUDS) at 1.25R.
# Run:  tools/p2shots --routes ascent --base BASE --branch BRANCH
# The sky over this port is clear on the first afternoon, so the route
# first runs the clock at 10000x to midnight (the port's midnight message
# drops it to 1x, which fixes the start), then 65 s at 1000x to about
# 18:00 on the second day, when the port is under an overcast.
# Expect: 01 the pad (external view) under the overcast, 02 the front view
#         just after lift-off with the nose a little up (the deck overhead,
#         the horizon in view), 03 climbing (d/R about 1.001), 04 in the
#         deck (about 1.002: the view whitened), 05 the rear view just above
#         it (about 1.003), 06 high (about 1.03, at 10x), 07 space (past the
#         1.25R hand-over).  The front view keeps the horizon in frame: with
#         the nose far up the game draws no planet, and so no deck.
# The d/R figures were read with a debug print; the clock steps are
# 1000x wall time, so a busy machine moves them a little.
# Each shot pauses the game (Esc) and resumes it at 1x (Shift+F1); the
# pointer is parked off the controls so no hover tip is drawn.
# Log markers: padtime..padend (landed, for frame timing), climb..climbend.

wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 2             # start position 2: landed at a surface port with an atmosphere
wait 11000
mouse 2 120
wait 300
sdlkey f5 shift   # 10000x: on to the midnight message (1x)
wait 15000
sdlkey f4 shift   # 1000x: to about 18:00 on the second day
wait 65000
sdlkey f1 shift   # 1x
mouse 8 193       # the view icon twice: the external view
wait 300
click 200
wait 1200
mouse 8 193
wait 300
click 200
wait 1200
mouse 2 120
log padtime
wait 15000
log padend
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 01-pad
sdlkey f1 shift
mouse 8 193       # the view icon again: the front view
wait 300
click 200
wait 1200
mouse 57 193      # comms: ask for launch clearance
wait 300
click 200
wait 2500
mouse 171 57
wait 300
click 200
wait 3000
mouse 263 193     # lift off
wait 300
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 2 120
wait 7000
press right       # five small pulls: the nose a little above the horizon
move 0 8 1 20
release right
wait 300
press right
move 0 8 1 20
release right
wait 300
press right
move 0 8 1 20
release right
wait 300
press right
move 0 8 1 20
release right
wait 300
press right
move 0 8 1 20
release right
wait 300
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 02-low
sdlkey f1 shift
log climb
keydown return    # full thrust
wait 6000
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 03-climb
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 9000
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 04-deck
sdlkey f1 shift
mouse 8 193       # the view icon: the rear view
wait 300
click 200
wait 1200
mouse 2 120
wait 4000
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 05-above
sdlkey f1 shift
sdlkey f2 shift   # 10x
wait 12000
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 06-high
sdlkey f1 shift
sdlkey f2 shift
wait 9000
sdlkey esc
wait 600
shot 07-space
log climbend
quit
